MindOS
A personal workspace for capturing thoughts, protecting focus, organizing ideas, and building intentional routines.

MindOS is a full-stack web application built with React, Node.js/Express, and MySQL. The application provides a personal workspace where authenticated users can manage their thoughts, mind check-ins, focus sessions, filters, and reprogramming routines.

The project is containerized with Docker and is being prepared for infrastructure deployment using Terraform.

